<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 24px; color: #1e293b; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 14px; background-color: #fef2f2; color: #dc2626; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
    .title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
    .content p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; }
    .reason-box { background-color: #fff1f2; border-left: 4px solid #e11d48; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .reason-title { font-weight: 600; color: #9f1239; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .reason-text { font-size: 15px; color: #881337; margin: 0; font-style: italic; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="badge">Security Notice</span>
      <h1 class="title">Account Suspended</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
      <p>We are writing to inform you that your HealthCare Portal account associated with <strong><%= email %></strong> has been suspended by an administrator.</p>
      
      <div class="reason-box">
        <div class="reason-title">Reason for Suspension</div>
        <p class="reason-text">"<%= reason %>"</p>
      </div>

      <p>While your account is suspended, access to booking consultations, telemedicine rooms, and profile management is restricted.</p>
      <p>If you believe this action was taken in error or if you wish to appeal this suspension, please contact our support desk.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Health Care System. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
